#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:2
msgid "Custom domains"
msgstr "自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:4
msgid ""
"By configuring a *custom domain* for your project, your project can serve "
"documentation from a domain you control, for instance ``docs.example.com``. "
"This is great for maintaining a consistent brand for your product and its "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"为项目配置*自定义域名* 后，项目可从你控制的域名提供文档服务，例如 "
"``docs.example.com``。这有助于为你的产品及其文档保持一致的品牌形象。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:12
msgid "Default subdomains"
msgstr "默认子域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:13
msgid ""
"*Without a custom domain configured*, your project's documentation is served"
" from a Read the Docs domain using a unique subdomain for your project:"
msgstr "*未配置自定义域名* 时，项目文档从 Read the Docs 域名通过为你项目生成的唯一子域名提供服务："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:16
msgid "``<project name>.readthedocs.io`` for |org_brand|."
msgstr "|org_brand| 使用 ``<project name>.readthedocs.io``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:17
msgid ""
"``<organization name>-<project name>.readthedocs-hosted.com`` for "
"|com_brand|. The addition of the organization name allows multiple "
"organizations to have projects with the same name."
msgstr ""
"|com_brand| 使用 ``<organization name>-<project name>.readthedocs-"
"hosted.com``。加上组织名可让多个组织拥有同名项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:22
msgid ":doc:`/guides/custom-domains`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/custom-domains`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:23
msgid "How to create and manage custom domains for your project."
msgstr "如何为项目创建和管理自定义域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:26
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:28
msgid "Automatic SSL"
msgstr "自动 SSL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:29
msgid ""
"SSL certificates are automatically issued through Cloudflare for every "
"custom domain. No extra set up is required beyond configuring your project's"
" custom domain."
msgstr "每个自定义域名的 SSL 证书都通过 Cloudflare 自动签发。除配置项目自定义域名外无需额外设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:32
msgid "CDN caching"
msgstr "CDN 缓存"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:33
msgid ""
"Response caching is provided through a :doc:`CDN </reference/cdn>` for all "
"documentation projects, including projects using a custom domain. CDN "
"caching improves page response time for your documentation's users, and the "
"CDN edge network provides low latency response times regardless of location."
msgstr ""
"所有文档项目（包括使用自定义域名的项目）都通过 :doc:`CDN </reference/cdn>` 提供响应缓存。CDN "
"缓存提升文档用户的页面响应速度，CDN 边缘网络无论用户位置如何都提供低延迟响应。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:38
msgid "Multiple domains"
msgstr "多域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:39
msgid ""
"Projects can be configured to be served from multiple domains, which always "
"includes the :ref:`project's default subdomain <default-subdomain>`. Only "
"one domain can be configured as the canonical domain however, and any "
"requests to non-canonical domains and subdomains will redirect to the "
"canonical domain."
msgstr ""
"项目可配置为从多个域名提供服务，其中始终包含 :ref:`项目默认子域名 <default-"
"subdomain>`。但只能配置一个规范域名，对非规范域名和子域名的请求都会重定向到规范域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:44
msgid "Canonical domains"
msgstr "规范域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:45
msgid ""
"The canonical domain configures the primary domain the documentation will "
"serve from, and also sets the domain search engines use for search results "
"when hosting from multiple domains. Projects can only have one canonical "
"domain, which is the :ref:`project's default subdomain <default-subdomain>` "
"if no other canonical domain is defined."
msgstr ""
"规范域名决定文档服务的主域名，并在多域名托管时设定搜索引擎用于搜索结果的域名。项目只能有一个规范域名，未定义其他规范域名时即为 "
":ref:`项目默认子域名 <default-subdomain>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:52
msgid ":doc:`/canonical-urls`"
msgstr ":doc:`/canonical-urls`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:53
msgid ""
"How canonical domains affect your project's canonical URL, and why canonical"
" URLs are important."
msgstr "规范域名如何影响项目的规范 URL，以及规范 URL 为何重要。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:56
msgid ":doc:`/subprojects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/subprojects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/custom-domains.rst:57
msgid "How to share a custom domain between multiple projects."
msgstr "如何在多个项目间共享自定义域名。"

